@redbtn:registry=https://registry.redbtn.io/
# The registry auth token is intentionally NOT committed. It is supplied at use
# time:
#   - Docker build: BuildKit secret mount (--mount=type=secret,id=npmrc), backed
#     by the global NPMRC redsecret RedRun injects into every git-source build.
#   - Local dev / CI: your personal ~/.npmrc, or the NPMRC Actions secret.
